# Debian package control file for callwarden-client
# Task: T-1783983162956-b2a8
# 角色 client: cw-client + MCP proxy，不含 parser/CAS（设计 §8.1 / §4.4）
# __VERSION__ / __ARCH__ 由 build_packages.sh 从 release/version.toml 注入

Package: callwarden-client
Version: __VERSION__
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Call Warden Team <team@callwarden.dev>
Description: Call Warden - Client (cw-client + MCP proxy)
 Lightweight client connecting to a remote Call Warden daemon
 via UDS. No local parser, CAS, or SQLite database.
 .
 Includes:
  - cw-client CLI
  - MCP proxy (forwards requests to daemon)
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
# P0-3 整改（2026-07-22）：PyInstaller --onedir 已打包 Python 解释器 + 全部依赖，
# 不再需要系统 python3。仅需 C 运行时库。
